Measured and not taken (docs/vm/qjs-observe.md sec.24): commit()'s band damage
from comparing each draw's entries with the shown frame's, instead of the band
hash. Applies to 97d647a with `git apply`; this is the run-cut version (runs of
PROC_RUN_ENTRIES entries per draw, masks kept behind each frame's entries) with
the host census under -DPOCKET_PROC_SIG_CHECK (draws unchanged, by kind).
proc_band_hash.h and tools/test_band_hash.c become unused with it.

